OpenVerse is OpenPak's own web application. It does not contain Juxtaposition's web views, styles or
templates. It does depend, at run time, on the miiverse-api of OpenPak's fork of Juxtaposition for
storage and for the Wii U and 3DS console protocol (see docs/architecture.md):

  Juxtaposition (apps/miiverse-api, apps/juxtaposition-ui)
  Copyright (C) Pretendo Network contributors
  https://github.com/PretendoNetwork/juxtaposition
  Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 only.

Console support in OpenVerse's later phases is written from the public Miiverse (olv) protocol
documentation, from captures, and with Juxtaposition as a behavioural reference. Where code is ported,
the file header names the upstream path and commit.

Typeface: M PLUS Rounded 1c, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (internal/web/static/fonts/OFL.txt).
internal/web/static/base.css is generated from openpak.org's stylesheet.
